---
title: Pineapple Coconut Smoothie
servings: 2
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
image: https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0243/5833/files/FEATURED-IMAGE-Creamy-Pineapple-Coconut-Smoothie-11-copy_92b8819a-7d08-434e-9eab-e68afd53b944_1.webp?v=1791924413&width=1000
source: https://mysolluna.com/blogs/recipes/creamy-pineapple-coconut-smoothie-recipe
---

In a #blender, blend together @coconut milk{1.25%cup}, @banana{1}(frozen), @?vanilla protein powder{1%scoop}, @vanilla extract{1/2%tsp}, @cinnamon{1/4%tsp}, @?coconut flakes{1/2%cup}, @?oatmeal{1/4%cup}, @?multi-vitamin{1}(grinded), and @?orange juice{splash} until smooth.